{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46133","headline":"春游灵泉寺 · 贯休","name":"春游灵泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水蹴危梁翠拥沙，钟声微径入深花。\n嘴红涧鸟啼芳草，头白山僧自扞茶。\n松色摧残遭贼火，水声幽咽落人家。\n因寻古迹空惆怅，满袖香风白日斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}